# Use Claude rules

If this repo has `CLAUDE.md` or `.claude/rules/`, treat them as Cursor rules.

1. At the start of a task, read `CLAUDE.md`.
2. Follow every file it imports under `.claude/rules/`.
3. Also follow any other `.claude/rules/*.md` in that folder.
4. Do not copy those files into `.cursor/rules/` unless the user asks.
5. If a Cursor rule and a Claude rule conflict, follow the Claude/project rule unless the user says otherwise.
